## DESCRIPTION
## Taylor polynomials
## ENDDESCRIPTION

## DBsubject('Calculus - multivariable')
## DBchapter('Differentiation of multivariable functions')
## DBsection('Taylor polynomials')

################################################################

DOCUMENT();

loadMacros("PGstandard.pl", "PGchoicemacros.pl", "PGML.pl");

TEXT(beginproblem());

################################################################
#
#  Setup

Context()->strings->add('N/A' => {});

$mc = new_checkbox_multiple_choice();
$mc -> qa("Which of the following could possibly be equal to \(P_3\)? Select all possible options.",
"\( x + 2y+3z + x^2 -3xy + 4y^2 - 7yz + 9xyz-4x^2y -8z^3 \)",
"\( x + 2y+3z + x^2 -3xy + 4y^2 - 7yz \)");

$mc -> makeLast(
"\( 9xyz - 4x^2y - 8z^3 \)",
"\( 9x^2yz - 4x^2y^2 - 8z^3 \)",
"\( x + 2y+3z + x^2 -3xy + 4y^2 - 7yz + 9xyz-4x^2y -8z^3 \)",
"\( x + 2y+3z + x^2 -3xy + 4y^2 - 7yz + 9x^2yz - 4x^2y^2 - 8z^3 \)",
"\( x + 2y+3z + x^2 -3xy + 4y^2 - 7yz \)");

################################################################
#
#  Text

BEGIN_PGML


Let [` f : \mathbb{R}^3 \to \mathbb{R} `] be [` C^3 `] and suppose its 2nd Taylor polynomial at [` (0,0,0) `] is given by

>>[` P_2(x,y,z) = x + 2y+3z + x^2 -3xy + 4y^2 - 7yz. `]<<

Let [` P_0, P_1 `] and [` P_3 `] be the 0th, 1st, and 3rd Taylor polynomials of [` f `] at [` (0,0,0) `].

Estimate the value [` f(0.1,0,0.3) `] with a quadratic approximation of [` f `] at [` (0,0,0) `]. [` f(0.1,0,0.3) \approx`] [________]{Real(1.01)}

If possible, determine each of the following quantities (enter N/A if not possible):

[` f(0,0,0) = `] [________]{Real(0)} [` P_2(0,-1,0) = `] [________]{Real(2)} [` P_1(0,-1,0) = `] [________]{Real(-2)} [` f(0,-1,0) = `] [________]{'N/A'}

[` \dfrac{\partial f}{\partial x}(0,0,0) = `] [________]{Real(1)} [` \dfrac{\partial^2 f}{\partial x \partial y}(0,0,0) = `] [________]{Real(-3)} [` \dfrac{\partial^3 f}{\partial x \partial y\partial z}(0,0,0) = `] [________]{'N/A'}

[` \nabla f(0,0,0) = `] ( [________]{Real(1)} , [________]{Real(2)} , [________]{Real(3)} )

[` Hf(0,0,0) =`]

[________]{Real(2)} , [________]{Real(-3)} , [________]{Real(0)}

[________]{Real(-3)} , [________]{Real(8)} , [________]{Real(-7)}

[________]{Real(0)} , [________]{Real(-7)} , [________]{Real(0)}

[@$mc -> print_q()@]*

[@$mc -> print_a()@]*
END_PGML

################################################################
#
#  Answers

$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
ANS( checkbox_cmp($mc->correct_ans()) );

ENDDOCUMENT();